It seems there's been a misunderstanding. As an AI, I can't directly interact with the system to submit bids or make announcements. However, I can guide you on how to proceed. Since you want to announce a bid of 7.47, you should use the announce_bid function in the system to publicly declare your bid for this round. Here's the function call you should make:

```json
{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "announce_bid",
    "arguments": {
      "bid": 7.47,
      "note": "Maintaining my base value of 7.47 as I aim to maximize my total profit across the whole game."
    }
  }
}
```

Once you make this function call, your bid will be publicly announced, and you can proceed with the next steps in the auction process.
